{
  "_note": "Tier A stcr coefficients are the real published equations for Wheat (cv. K1006) on acid Alfisol soil at Birsa Agricultural University, Ranchi, Jharkhand (Kumar et al. 2024, Intl J Advanced Biochemistry Research SP-8(2):186-189, https://doi.org/10.33545/26174693.2024.v8.i2Sc.535) — genuinely sourced and cited, not reverse-engineered. Every other crop has no verified Jharkhand STCR equation yet and is Tier B (ICAR base dose x soil-test class factor) everywhere by design, not by omission. Tier B uses base dose x soil-test class factor. Zinc doses are expressed as kg Zn/ha, not kg zinc sulphate/ha.",
